---

`skills/recipe-nourishible/` vendors two things with their own history:

- Video download/frame/transcript scripts (`scripts/*.py`, excluding `capture/`)
  originally from the MIT-licensed `/watch` skill by bradautomates
  (https://github.com/bradautomates/claude-video) — see that skill's own
  license/attribution notice, carried forward in the vendored copy.
- The Instagram screen-capture pipeline (`scripts/capture/`) originally from `ig-saved`,
  an earlier project by the same team as this repo. See `skills/recipe-nourishible/
  SKILL.md`'s Attribution section and `docs/capture/CONTRACT.md` for the acquisition rule
  that pipeline exists to satisfy.
